    "description": "This amazing property is located on a desirable block of fabulous Nob Hill. Within minutes of iconic neighboring districts of North Beach, Chinatown, Russian Hill, Marina, Pacific Heights, Financial District, Japantown, there are numerous world class cuisines, entertainment, shopping, amenities & attractions in the area. The Embarcadero, Fisherman's Wharf, Ghirardelli Square, Pier 39, Union St., Coit Tower, Palace of Fine Arts, Grace Cathedral, the Fairmont Hotel, House of Prime Rib are just a few minutes drive. This 3 unit building offers high ceilings, original details, hardwood flooring, updated kitchens and baths, a total of 13 rooms, plus 2+ car garage, and bonus rooms. The top unit occupies the entire floor & has a deck. The middle level consists of 2 remodeled units. The ground level offers 2+ car garage, storage rooms, 2 legal bonus rooms & 1 legal bathroom(per 3R). There is a large landscaped backyard with fruit trees, a big patio and a newer fence. Views of the Golden Gate Bridge can be seen from the rear side of the building. This property is a short stroll away to countless neighborhood amenities and public transportation. This is a great opportunity to experience the renowned San Francisco living."
